WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.160
Ghana's image

00:02.160 --> 00:04.280
on the international stage

00:04.280 --> 00:07.120
has been positively boosted by our world acclaimed

00:07.120 --> 00:09.120
reset agenda.

00:09.680 --> 00:11.720
Our young people

00:11.720 --> 00:13.920
are Ghana's greatest

00:13.920 --> 00:15.360
assets.

00:15.720 --> 00:20.120
We're beginning to see significant growth in sectoral performance.

00:20.480 --> 00:23.160
Construction, manufacturing,

00:23.160 --> 00:25.240
agriculture, and services

00:25.240 --> 00:27.760
are showing very strong growth.

00:28.160 --> 00:31.000
This is creating a new opportunity

00:31.000 --> 00:33.400
for decent employment for our youth.

00:33.400 --> 00:53.640
[music]

00:54.040 --> 00:58.200
We're accelerating economic growth and creating more opportunities for our young people.

00:59.040 --> 01:02.240
We've restored business confidence and have seen

01:02.240 --> 01:04.600
a significant increase

01:04.600 --> 01:08.520
in both domestic and foreign direct investment.

01:09.000 --> 01:13.120
We're working to achieve 30% share of renewable energy

01:13.120 --> 01:15.480
in our national energy mix,

01:15.480 --> 01:17.360
reducing costs

01:17.360 --> 01:19.480
and protecting our environment.

01:20.800 --> 01:23.240
Infrastructure is the backbone of development.

01:24.480 --> 01:26.560
We have begun

01:26.560 --> 01:30.920
the rehabilitation of over 2,000 kilometers of roads nationwide.

01:31.960 --> 01:36.440
We've restored a consistent supply of electricity

01:36.440 --> 01:40.400
and are expanding the rural electrification network to more than a thousand

01:40.400 --> 01:42.200
additional communities.

01:42.200 --> 01:57.480
[music]

01:58.120 --> 02:01.440
To our entrepreneurs and business leaders,

02:02.040 --> 02:04.280
invest in Ghana,

02:04.280 --> 02:07.400
build your businesses that create jobs and wealth

02:07.400 --> 02:11.880
for yourselves and for the Ghanaian economy. I pledge to maintain a conducive

02:11.880 --> 02:15.000
environment for your businesses to thrive.

02:15.360 --> 02:17.080
Your commitment

02:17.080 --> 02:19.240
must be to seize the opportunities that we create.

02:19.240 --> 02:26.040
[music]
